# Generated artefacts and raw trace data are NOT tracked. Everything here is
# source: harness, sweep orchestration, analysis and figure generators.
#
# The data these scripts consume lives outside the repo, on the machine that
# produced it (see README.md for paths and sizes). It is ~3 GB of per-episode
# .npy/.npz/.json plus rendered .png/.mp4, which does not belong in git and can
# be regenerated from the scripts here given GPU time.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.mp4
*.svg
*.npy
*.npz
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.frames/
# per-cell trace output (energy2.json, summary.json, ep*_bodies.json)
traces_*/
plane3_runs/
plane3_archive/
runs/
runs_*/
videos/
videos_*/
smoke_*/
